; Everything the real dinput8.dll exports, so a game linked against it finds
; what it expects here. DirectInput8Create is the one XIII actually imports;
; the rest are the standard COM entry points and are forwarded for anything
; else in the process that goes looking.
;
; Undecorated on purpose. These are __stdcall, so the linker would otherwise
; export _DirectInput8Create@20 and the game's import by plain name would not
; resolve, which on a statically imported DLL means the process never starts.
LIBRARY dinput8
EXPORTS
    DirectInput8Create
    DllCanUnloadNow
    DllGetClassObject
    DllRegisterServer
    DllUnregisterServer
